          {
            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Echium tuberculatum is a species of flowering plant native to Portugal, Morocco, Algeria and Libya in the Iberian Peninsula and North Africa respectively. This plant is a hardy garden perennial and it forms a sprawling mass of red flowers during the whole of the summer."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "It will self-seed readily."
          }
